.
.  Create a GIF file for a block plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
SET IPL1NA BLOCKPLT.PS
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ LIU.DAT Y BIT1 BIT2 BIT3 BIT4 BIT5 SETTING DEVICE
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
CHARACTER 0 1
CHARACTER SIZE 3.5
LINE BLANK BLANK
.
MEAN BLOCK PLOT Y DEVICE BIT1 SUBSET DEVICE 1 TO 44
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
.
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
SYSTEM mv BLOCKPLT.PS blockplt.ps
.
QUIT
